| A2      | Authenticated User                                  | External Actor     | Uploads papers, collaborates         |
| A3      | Admin                                               | External Actor     | Admin endpoints, moderation, ops     |
| E1      | OAuth Provider (Google)                             | External System    | OAuth sign-in                        |
